WEBVTT

1
00:00:09,970 --> 00:00:11,970
Is it so easy to kill and bury artists?

2
00:00:12,570 --> 00:00:13,770
A little disgusting

3
00:00:13,970 --> 00:00:15,570
Do I want to be like that uncle?

4
00:00:15,770 --> 00:00:17,970
Just reach in and steal? OMG?

5
00:00:18,170 --> 00:00:20,770
They looked so safe in the killing chamber, so should we?

6
00:00:20,770 --> 00:00:22,970
You can use some defensive relationships to walk around and get too stressed out.

7
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:28,340
That girl is dirty

8
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:30,690
You go and have a look

9
00:00:30,890 --> 00:00:35,250
Do you want help getting the gold box? No thank you.

10
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:36,250
You stand back

11
00:00:40,790 --> 00:00:42,790
The boss is a bit unlucky.

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,380
Boss Xia, don’t change your mind or try again.

13
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:46,780
Based on my experience, there are three of them.

14
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:49,380
No matter what, I got a gold box. Thank you, grandpa. No need.

15
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:50,380
I just came out to have fun

16
00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:51,580
I didn’t plan to kill so many people and lose so much.

17
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:53,380
Don't look at my wife's cold face

18
00:00:53,580 --> 00:00:55,980
It was she who reminded me to come and help you just now
